<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Oncology raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Oncology raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch raised American Oncology Resources to near-term accumulate from neutral, keeping it as a long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 to 8-5/8.</p>
</text>
